IF ZH
TEXT "以下按字母顺序分组列出了本程序支持的全部站点。"
TEXT "站点名称后可能出现上标，用于说明连接特性及程序行为。若未"
TEXT "出现任何上标，则该站点仅通过本地 Nginx 代理，或其 DNS"
TEXT "解析在部分运营商网络中存在异常，此时程序会直接连接该站点。"
TEXT "“E” 表示该站点支持 ECH。程序将通过 ECH 方式与其建立连接。"
TEXT "“R” 表示程序将通过 IPv6 连接该站点。这可能是由于该站点存在"
TEXT "地区限制，程序会将其 IPv4 地址转换为公共 NAT64 IPv6 地址"
TEXT "发起连接以绕过限制，也可能出于其他原因。"
TEXT "无论是否带有标注，各站点的实际连接速度均会受运营商、访问"
TEXT "时段以及程序所使用的优选域名质量等因素影响，无法预先保证。"
TEXT "如需正常使用标注 “R” 的站点，须本地网络支持公共 IPv6 访问。"
LINK "测试 IPv6 连通性" "https://test-ipv6.com"
ELSE
TEXT "The following is an alphabetical list of all supported sites in this program."
TEXT "Superscripts may appear after site names to indicate connection characteristics"
TEXT "and program behavior. If no superscript is present, the site is accessed solely via"
TEXT "a local Nginx proxy, or its DNS resolution is abnormal on certain Internet Service"
TEXT "Provider (ISP) networks, in which case the program connects to it directly."
TEXT "\"E\": Indicates that the site supports ECH (Encrypted Client Hello). The program"
TEXT "will establish a connection using ECH."
TEXT "\"R\": Indicates that the program will connect to the site via IPv6. This may be due"
TEXT "to regional restrictions—where the program translates the site's IPv4 address into"
TEXT "a public NAT64 IPv6 address to bypass restrictions—or for other reasons."
TEXT "Regardless of whether a superscript is present, actual connection speeds for all"
TEXT "sites are subject to factors such as your ISP, access time periods, and the quality"
TEXT "of the optimized domain names used by the program, and therefore cannot be"
TEXT "guaranteed in advance. Proper usage of sites marked with 'R' requires local"
TEXT "network support for public IPv6 access."
LINK "Test IPv6 Connectivity" "https://test-ipv6.com"
ENDIF
